#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:2
msgid "Instance Tabs"
msgstr "Guias de Instância"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:4
msgid "Customize the UI for your Instances by providing your own tabs."
msgstr "Personalize a interface para suas Instâncias fornecendo suas próprias guias."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:7
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Configuração"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:8
msgid ""
"Create a new class that extends "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.AbstractInstanceTabProvider``. When the Morpheus "
"UI builds the Instance UI it calls the ``renderTemplate`` method. Below "
"is a simple example binding the Instance object to the template model."
msgstr "Crie uma nova classe que estenda ``com.morpheusdata.core.AbstractInstanceTabProvider``. Quando a interface do Morpheus constrói a interface da Instância, ela chama o método ``renderTemplate``. Abaixo está um exemplo simples que vincula o objeto Instance ao modelo do template."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"HTMLResponse renderTemplate(Instance instance) {\n"
"  ViewModel<String> model = new ViewModel<String>()\n"
"  model.object = instance\n"
"  getRenderer().renderTemplate(\"hbs/instanceTab\", model)\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:20
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Dica"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:20
msgid ""
"Use ``MorpheusContext.buildInstanceConfig`` to get more details about "
"your Instance. See ``com.morpheusdata.model.TaskConfig``"
msgstr "Use ``MorpheusContext.buildInstanceConfig`` para obter mais detalhes sobre sua Instância. Consulte ``com.morpheusdata.model.TaskConfig``"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:22
msgid ""
"Handlebars <https://github.com/jknack/handlebars.java> is the default "
"provided template engine. To override this default, implement the "
"``com.morpheusdata.core.InstanceTabProvider`` interface and then write "
"your own ``getRenderer()`` method."
msgstr "Handlebars <https://github.com/jknack/handlebars.java> é o mecanismo de template padrão fornecido. Para substituir esse padrão, implemente a interface ``com.morpheusdata.core.InstanceTabProvider`` e escreva seu próprio método ``getRenderer()``."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:26
msgid "Templating"
msgstr "Templates"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:27
msgid ""
"See the Views <https://github.com/gomorpheus/morpheus-plugin-"
"core/blob/master/morpheus-plugin-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/Views.adoc> "
"section and the documentation for your templating engine for specific "
"syntax."
msgstr "Consulte a seção Views <https://github.com/gomorpheus/morpheus-plugin-core/blob/master/morpheus-plugin-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/Views.adoc> e a documentação do seu mecanismo de template para a sintaxe específica."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:31
msgid "Security Policies"
msgstr "Políticas de Segurança"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:34
msgid "User Permissions"
msgstr "Permissões de Usuário"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:35
msgid ""
"Before a template is rendered in the UI, the ``InstanceTabProvider.show``"
" method is called to determine if the current user can view the custom "
"Instance Tab. For example, you may wish to check that the current "
"``User`` has been granted the custom permission defined by your plugin."
msgstr "Antes de um template ser renderizado na interface, o método ``InstanceTabProvider.show`` é chamado para determinar se o usuário atual pode visualizar a guia personalizada da Instância. Por exemplo, você pode verificar se o ``User`` atual recebeu a permissão personalizada definida pelo seu plugin."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:37
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"Boolean show(Instance instance, User user, Account account) {\n"
"  def show = true\n"
"  plugin.permissions.each { Permission permission ->\n"
"    if(user.permissions[permission.code] != "
"permission.availableAccessTypes.last().toString()){\n"
"      show = false\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"  return show\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:52
msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "Política de Segurança de Conteúdo"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:53
msgid ""
"If your custom UI needs to include external resources such as scripts, "
"stylesheets, or frames, you will need to customize the Morpheus "
"``Content-Security-Policy`` Header to allow those elements to be loaded "
"in the browser."
msgstr "Se sua interface personalizada precisar incluir recursos externos, como scripts, folhas de estilo ou frames, você precisará personalizar o cabeçalho ``Content-Security-Policy`` do Morpheus para permitir que esses elementos sejam carregados no navegador."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugin_examples/PluginsTab.rst:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"TabContentSecurityPolicy getContentSecurityPolicy() {\n"
"  def csp = new TabContentSecurityPolicy()\n"
"  csp.scriptSrc = '*.jsdelivr.net'\n"
"  csp.frameSrc = '*.digitalocean.com'\n"
"  csp.imgSrc = '*.wikimedia.org'\n"
"  csp.styleSrc = 'https: *.bootstrapcdn.com'\n"
"  csp\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

